諾瑪（NYSE：WSM）進入假期？"},{"title":"If You Invested $1000 In Williams-Sonoma Stock 15 Years Ago, You Would Have This Much Today","src":"Benzinga","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPVGZaOFlYVTI3MENuREdQU0lsRmFLalE2RlBlNUpNYnJWTmptR1lxZXBWUzYtNVM1ODUyMVNDNjNLRm9tQzFqRkJTUE4wU1RRT0p3MDNmcEMtdFBLWHhhcFcyb21YZGZ2OUk3Vzk0bllLYS1QWnd4cmlzYktDaWstRFlSSTFtMU12VGN1ZG10STZNTElpOUwtcGw5M3V3dURrOVZ2aG8ydDRMclNRdUZ1bmU4V0E5akF2VllRc2ZkMDRUai0y?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"如果 15 年前您投資 1000 美元購買 Williams-Sonoma 股票，今天您將擁有這麼多"},{"title":"Yes, There’s an Advent Calendar for Everything — Here Are 27 to Grab ASAP, Before They Sell Out","src":"Food & Wine","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxOSzI0Qi1nemRoWFo1YjlpUWIwa3RvT3hzQ010U1E0elYwdllHWHpGbUp3cENUZ3ZQalRMU0lQR0k3LVlnVy1uZzNObVZYNFU2dmdiNnlBRTB5bzdBUENHeHpNWU9KdV9ZY3dURFM1Nm5YbXJSd1BRdzR2NjdESDFlTg?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"是的，一切都有一個降臨節日曆 — 這裡有 27 個，請盡快購買，以免售完"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-26","period":"2026-02-01","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/719955/000071995526000059/wsm-20260201.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Williams-Sonoma, Inc., (the \"Company\", \"we\", or \"us\") incorporated in 1973, is an omni-channel specialty retailer of high-quality products for the home.","zh":"Williams-Sonoma, Inc.（以下簡稱「本公司」或「我們」）成立於 1973 年，是一家高品質家居產品的全通路專業零售商。"},{"en":"In 1956, our founder, Chuck Williams, turned a passion for cooking and eating with friends into a small business with a big idea. He opened a store in Sonoma, California to sell the French cookware that intrigued him while visiting Europe but that could not be found in America. Chuck's business, which set a standard for customer service, took off and helped fuel a revolution in American cooking and entertaining that continues today.","zh":"1956 年，我們的創辦人查克威廉斯 (Chuck Williams) 將與朋友一起烹飪和用餐的熱情變成了一家擁有遠大創意的小企業。他在加州索諾瑪開設了一家商店，販售法國炊具，這些炊具在他訪問歐洲時引起了他的興趣，但在美國卻找不到。查克的业务为客户服务树立了标准，并推动了美国烹饪和娱乐领域的一场革命，这场革命一直持续至今。"},{"en":"In the decades that followed, our commitment to product quality, our ability to identify new market opportunities and our people-first business approach have driven our expansion beyond the kitchen into nearly every area of the home, as well as the places where our customers work, stay and play. Our in-house design capabilities and vertically integrated sourcing organization allow us to deliver high-quality, lasting products at competitive prices. Through our e-commerce platform, our in-house marketing and data analytics teams optimize our digital spend and customer connections. We have expanded our in-store services to not only provide world-class customer service but to also serve as design centers and omni-fulfillment hubs.","zh":"在接下來的幾十年裡，我們對產品品質的承諾、我們發現新市場機會的能力以及我們以人為本的業務方針推動我們從廚房擴展到家庭的幾乎每個區域，以及我們的客戶工作、住宿和娛樂的地方。我们的内部设计能力和垂直整合的采购组织使我们能够以具有竞争力的价格提供高质量、持久的产品。通过我们的电子商务平台，我们的内部营销和数据分析团队优化了我们的数字支出和客户联系。我们扩展了店内服务，不仅提供世界一流的客户服务，而且还充当设计中心和全方位履行中心。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-02-01","items":[{"name":"Reportable","val":7806816000,"zh":"報告分部"},{"name":"Pottery Barn","val":2999332000,"zh":"陶器穀倉部門"},{"name":"West Elm","val":1859501000,"zh":"西榆樹段"},{"name":"Williams Sonoma","val":1362308000,"zh":"威廉斯索諾瑪段"},{"name":"Pottery Barn Kids & Teen","val":1138051000,"zh":"Pottery Barn Kids & Teen"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":447624000,"zh":"所有其他部門"}],"total":7806816000}},"peers":["RH","DKS","ROST","TSCO","ULTA"]}}